@host = http://localhost:5080
@aliceIncidentId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Health/readiness
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Working list flow
GET {{host}}/api/incidents
Accept: application/json

### Filtered list
GET {{host}}/api/incidents?status=Triaged
Accept: application/json

### Existing details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceIncidentId}}
Accept: application/json

### Missing resource: expected 404 Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999
Accept: application/json

### Invalid filter: expected 400 Validation Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents?status=Unknown
Accept: application/json

### Severity summary — success, no filter: expected 200, 3 groups (High/Medium/Low), no Critical
# Contract (LR1, Stage 3):
# - GET /api/incidents/severity-summary?status={optional}
# - Zero-group policy: include only existing groups (exclude Critical if count = 0)
# - Order: by descending severity (Critical -> High -> Medium -> Low)
# - status: IncidentStatus allowlist (New/Triaged/InProgress/Resolved/Closed), 400 if invalid
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary
Accept: application/json

### Severity summary — filtered by valid status: expected 200, subset of groups
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=New
Accept: application/json

### Severity summary — filtered by status with no matching incidents: expected 200, empty array
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=Closed
Accept: application/json

### Severity summary — invalid status: expected 400 Validation Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/severity-summary?status=Unknown
Accept: application/json
